## Supabase

- **Project URL**: `https://itmtmeobsclhyczidjct.supabase.co`
- **Anon key**: stored in `lib/supabase.ts`
- **Auth methods**: Email/Password + Google OAuth

### Database Tables

```sql
profiles (
  id uuid references auth.users(id) primary key,
  username text unique not null,
  display_name text,
  avatar_url text,
  bio text,
  followers_count integer default 0,
  following_count integer default 0,
  created_at timestamp with time zone default now()
)
```

### Trigger
`handle_new_user()` auto-creates a profile row on signup.
Falls back to email prefix as username if none provided via `raw_user_meta_data`.

### Planned Tables (not yet created)
- `tracks` — uploaded music/video files
- `playlists` — user playlists
- `playlist_tracks` — many-to-many
- `follows` — user follow relationships
- `messages` — chat messages
- `jam_rooms` — listen-together sessions

